---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Brand from '../components/Brand.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy policy | PMS Check"
  description="How PMS Check handles the email addresses you give us for the waitlist."
>
  <header class="nav">
    <div class="wrap nav-in">
      <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="PMS Check home">
        <Brand />
      </a>
      <a class="btn" href="/#join">Join the waitlist</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main id="main" class="legal">
    <div class="wrap narrow">
      <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
      <p class="updated">Effective November 25, 2026. Last updated November 25, 2026.</p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>
        The only personal information we collect is the email address you type into a waitlist form on this site. The form also records which page it came from, so we know which sign-up location is working.
      </p>
      <p>
        We don't ask for your name, phone number, car registration, or any part of your quote on this site. Nothing you type or scan into the product is sent to us through this site.
      </p>

      <h2>Why we use it</h2>
      <p>
        We use your email for one purpose: to tell you once when PMS Check opens. We won't send you marketing or other emails, and we won't share or sell your address.
      </p>

      <h2>Who processes it</h2>
      <p>
        Your address is stored in a Google Sheet that Kowdstudio controls. Google processes it only to host that sheet. Google's privacy policy is at <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">policies.google.com/privacy</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
      <p>
        We keep your address until you ask us to delete it. Once we receive that request, we delete the row from the Google Sheet.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        Under the Data Privacy Act you can ask what we hold about you, ask us to correct it, ask us to delete it, and withdraw consent at any time. To do any of these, email kowdstudio+privacy@gmail.com. We'll reply within 48 hours.
      </p>

      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        PMS Check is operated by KowdStudio, Philippines. Our data protection contact is KowdStudio, kowdstudio+privacy@gmail.com.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>
        If we change how we handle your address, we'll update this page and the date above. For anything that changes how we use emails we already hold, we'll ask you again first.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="wrap foot">
      <Brand size={28} />
      <p>© 2026 KowdStudio. All rights reserved.</p>
      <nav class="foot-links" aria-label="Legal">
        <a href="/privacy/">Privacy policy</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </footer>
</Base>

<style>
  .nav {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 20;
    backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
    background: rgba(241, 243, 248, 0.8);
  }
  .nav-in {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    height: 64px;
  }
  .brand {
    display: inline-flex;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }
  .legal {
    padding-block: 48px 72px;
  }
  .narrow {
    max-width: 680px;
  }
  .draft {
    background: var(--color-optional-bg);
    color: var(--color-optional);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    font-size: var(--text-small);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 40px);
  }
  .updated {
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-size: var(--text-small);
    color: var(--color-ink-faint);
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: var(--text-title);
    margin-top: 36px;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }
  .legal p {
    margin-top: 12px;
    font-size: var(--text-read);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-ink-soft);
  }
  .foot {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 16px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--color-ink-faint);
  }
  .foot-links a {
    color: var(--color-ink-soft);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
</style>
